msgid ""
"By default the cover is stretched to fill the whole screen, which can "
"distort it if its proportions don't match your screen's. When on, the cover "
"keeps its original proportions instead, centered over a black background."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, la portada se estira para llenar toda la pantalla, lo que puede "
"distorsionarla si sus proporciones no coinciden con las de la pantalla. Al "
"activarlo, la portada mantiene sus proporciones originales, centrada sobre "
"un fondo negro."

